Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 08:42:39 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] test(core): preserve cross-provider children through v2
 eviction


diff --git a/codex-rs/core/src/agent/control_tests.rs b/codex-rs/core/src/agent/control_tests.rs
index c98f36bdcda2ea06f54ac3291b4dc80005ba5cbe..d3ccdb172611c9031b89cf030f7add9509253958 100644
--- a/codex-rs/core/src/agent/control_tests.rs
+++ b/codex-rs/core/src/agent/control_tests.rs
